  "title": "Emily's Strawberry Balsamic Salad",
  "description": "Bursting with tangy flavor, a rich balsamic dressing seasoned with garlic, mustard, honey, and shallots perfectly complements a green salad garnished with strawberries, toasted almonds, and feta cheese.",
